{"id":"1t-1-2","courseId":"1t","chapterNumber":"1.2","title":"Poteanssat","description":"Oahpa poteanssaid, poteansanjuolggadusaid ja rehkenastinnjuolggadusaid birra ollislohkoeksponeanttaid (no: heltallseksponenter) várás.","estimatedMinutes":45,"competenceGoals":["guorahallat ja válddahallat poteanssaid iešvuođaid"],"content":[{"id":"1t-1-2-intro","type":"text","content":"Muhtumin mii háliidit válddahallat ahte lohku gerdojuvvo iežainis máŋgii álkit vugiin. Dan sajis go čállit $2 \\cdot 2 \\cdot 2 \\cdot 2$ sáhttit čállit $2^4$, ja dan sajis go $a \\cdot a \\cdot a = a^3$."},{"id":"1t-1-2-def-1","type":"definition","title":"Poteansa","content":"Go mii čállit $x^n$, dat mearkkaša ahte mii geardut $x$ iežainis $n$ gearddi:\n\n$$x^n = x \\cdot x \\cdot x \\cdot \\ldots \\cdot x \\quad (n \\text{ fáktora})$$\n\nMii gohčodit $x$ **vuođđolohkun** ja $n$ **eksponeantan**.\n\nOvdamearkka dihte: $2^3 = 2 \\cdot 2 \\cdot 2 = 8$ (vuođđolohku 2, eksponeanta 3) ja $a^5 = a \\cdot a \\cdot a \\cdot a \\cdot a$."},{"id":"1t-1-2-example-1","type":"example","title":"Ovdamearka 1","problem":"Rehkenaste:\n\na) $2^4$\nb) $4 \\cdot 3^2$","solution":"**Čoavddus:**\n\na) $2^4 = 2 \\cdot 2 \\cdot 2 \\cdot 2 = 16$\n\nb) $4 \\cdot 3^2 = 4 \\cdot 3 \\cdot 3 = 4 \\cdot 9 = 36$","solutionVideo":"v0cGNIaTOM0"},{"id":"1t-1-2-ex-block-1","type":"exercise","exercise":{"id":"1t-1-2-ex-1","number":"1","type":"classic","difficulty":"lett","task":"Rehkenaste","subTasks":[{"label":"a","task":"$2^3$","solution":"$2^3 = 8$","answer":8},{"label":"b","task":"$9^2$","solution":"$9^2 = 81$","answer":81},{"label":"c","task":"$2^2 \\cdot 5^2$","solution":"$2^2 \\cdot 5^2 = 4 \\cdot 25 = 100$","answer":100},{"label":"d","task":"$3^3 \\cdot 2$","solution":"$3^3 \\cdot 2 = 27 \\cdot 2 = 54$","answer":54},{"label":"e","task":"$7^2 \\cdot 2^2$","solution":"$7^2 \\cdot 2^2 = 49 \\cdot 4 = 196$","answer":196},{"label":"f","task":"$1^3 \\cdot 2^3 \\cdot 3^2$","solution":"$1^3 \\cdot 2^3 \\cdot 3^2 = 1 \\cdot 8 \\cdot 9 = 72$","answer":72}],"hints":["Muitte ahte $a^n = a \\cdot a \\cdot \\ldots \\cdot a$ ($n$ gearddi)"],"solution":"a) 8, b) 81, c) 100, d) 54, e) 196, f) 72","solutionVideo":"ay0y60pJvmQ","allowsUpload":true,"allowsCanvasDrawing":true}},{"id":"1t-1-2-text-regel1","type":"text","content":"Dás galgat oahppat rehkenastit poteanssaiguin. Mii sáhttit vákšut ahte:\n$$x^2 \\cdot x^3 = (x \\cdot x) \\cdot (x \\cdot x \\cdot x) = x^5$$\n\nObbalaččat sáhttit boktit njuolggadusa:\n$$x^a \\cdot x^b = x^{a+b}$$"},{"id":"1t-1-2-theorem-1","type":"theorem","title":"Poteansanjuolggadus: Geardun","content":"$$x^a \\cdot x^b = x^{a+b}$$"},{"id":"1t-1-2-example-2","type":"example","title":"Ovdamearka 2","problem":"Rehkenaste ja čále bohtosa poteansan:\n\na) $3^4 \\cdot 3^5$\nb) $2a \\cdot 2a^4$\nc) $a^3 \\cdot b^2 \\cdot a^5 \\cdot b^3$","solution":"**Čoavddus:**\n\na) $3^4 \\cdot 3^5 = 3^{4+5} = 3^9$\n\nb) $2a \\cdot 2a^4 = \\color{blue}{2 \\cdot 2 \\cdot a^1 \\cdot a^4} = 2^2 a^{1+4} = 2^2 a^5$\n\nc) $a^3 \\cdot b^2 \\cdot a^5 \\cdot b^3 = a^3 \\cdot a^5 \\cdot b^2 \\cdot b^3 = a^{3+5} \\cdot b^{2+3} = a^8 b^5$","solutionVideo":"9uP8A9JMOoM"},{"id":"1t-1-2-tip-1","type":"tip","content":"**Muitte: Oaidnemeahttun geardunmearka**\n\n$ab = a \\cdot b$\n\n$3a = 3 \\cdot a$"},{"id":"1t-1-2-ex-block-2","type":"exercise","exercise":{"id":"1t-1-2-ex-2","number":"2","type":"classic","difficulty":"lett","task":"Rehkenaste ja čále bohtosa poteansan","subTasks":[{"label":"a","task":"$x^2 \\cdot x^3$","solution":"$x^2 \\cdot x^3 = x^{2+3} = x^5$","expressionAnswer":"x^5"},{"label":"b","task":"$2^5 \\cdot 2^{10}$","solution":"$2^5 \\cdot 2^{10} = 2^{5+10} = 2^{15}$","expressionAnswer":"2^15"},{"label":"c","task":"$a^3 \\cdot a^5 \\cdot b^2$","solution":"$a^3 \\cdot a^5 \\cdot b^2 = a^{3+5} \\cdot b^2 = a^8 b^2$","expressionAnswer":"a^8*b^2"},{"label":"d","task":"$x^3 y^2 \\cdot x^2 \\cdot y^6$","solution":"$x^3 y^2 \\cdot x^2 \\cdot y^6 = x^{3+2} y^{2+6} = x^5 y^8$","expressionAnswer":"x^5*y^8"},{"label":"e","task":"$3x^2 \\cdot 4x$","solution":"$3x^2 \\cdot 4x = 12x^{2+1} = 12x^3$","expressionAnswer":"12x^3"},{"label":"f","task":"$9x^3 y^3 \\cdot x^2$","solution":"$9x^3 y^3 \\cdot x^2 = 9x^{3+2} y^3 = 9x^5 y^3$","expressionAnswer":"9x^5*y^3"}],"hints":["Geavat njuolggadusa $x^a \\cdot x^b = x^{a+b}$"],"solution":"a) $x^5$, b) $2^{15}$, c) $a^8 b^2$, d) $x^5 y^8$, e) $12x^3$, f) $9x^5 y^3$","solutionVideo":"iTqORB5daLU","allowsUpload":true,"allowsCanvasDrawing":true}},{"id":"1t-1-2-text-regel2","type":"text","content":"Go bargat poteanssaiguin cuovkkain, de lea dehálaš muitit ahte mii sáhttit geardut ja juohkit seamma loguin cuovkkasáju bajábealde ja vuolábealde. Dehálaš lea maiddái muitit ahte mii danin sáhttit sihkkut seammalágan fáktoriid cuovkkasáju bajábealde ja vuolábealde guhtet guoimmiska vuostá.\n\nMis lea ovdamearkka dihte ahte:\n$$\\frac{4^5}{4^2} = \\frac{4 \\cdot 4 \\cdot 4 \\cdot \\color{red}{4 \\cdot 4}}{\\color{red}{4 \\cdot 4}} = 4^{5-2} = 4^3$$"},{"id":"1t-1-2-theorem-2","type":"theorem","title":"Poteansanjuolggadus: Juohkin","content":"$$\\frac{x^a}{x^b} = x^{a-b}$$"},{"id":"1t-1-2-example-3","type":"example","title":"Ovdamearka 3","problem":"Rehkenaste ja čále bohtosa poteansan:\n\na) $\\frac{9^5}{9^2}$\n\nb) $\\frac{x^4 y^3}{x^2 y^2}$","solution":"**Čoavddus:**\n\na) **1. molssaeaktu:**\n$$\\frac{9^5}{9^2} = 9^{5-2} = 9^3$$\n\n**2. molssaeaktu:** (Mii fáktoriserejit ja sihkkut seammalágan seammalágana vuostá)\n$$\\frac{9^5}{9^2} = \\frac{9^3 \\cdot \\color{red}{9^2}}{\\color{red}{9^2}} = 9^3$$\n\nb) **1. molssaeaktu:**\n$$\\frac{x^4 y^3}{x^2 y^2} = \\color{blue}{\\frac{x^4}{x^2} \\cdot \\frac{y^3}{y^2}} = x^{4-2} \\cdot y^{3-2} = x^2 y$$\n\n**2. molssaeaktu:** (Mii fáktoriserejit ja sihkkut seammalágan seammalágana vuostá)\n$$\\frac{x^4 y^3}{x^2 y^2} = \\frac{\\color{red}{x^2} \\cdot x^2 \\cdot \\color{red}{y^2} \\cdot y}{\\color{red}{x^2} \\cdot \\color{red}{y^2}} = x^2 y$$","solutionVideo":"qorkJ6UpJwI"},{"id":"1t-1-2-ex-block-3","type":"exercise","exercise":{"id":"1t-1-2-ex-3","number":"3","type":"classic","difficulty":"medium","task":"Rehkenaste ja čále bohtosa poteansan","subTasks":[{"label":"a","task":"$\\frac{7^4}{7^3}$","solution":"$\\frac{7^4}{7^3} = 7^{4-3} = 7$","expressionAnswer":"7"},{"label":"b","task":"$\\frac{a^7}{a^2}$","solution":"$\\frac{a^7}{a^2} = a^{7-2} = a^5$","expressionAnswer":"a^5"},{"label":"c","task":"$\\frac{a^3 b^4}{ab^2}$","solution":"$\\frac{a^3 b^4}{ab^2} = a^{3-1} b^{4-2} = a^2 b^2$","expressionAnswer":"a^2*b^2"},{"label":"d","task":"$\\frac{2^4 \\cdot 5^7}{2^3 \\cdot 5^4}$","solution":"$\\frac{2^4 \\cdot 5^7}{2^3 \\cdot 5^4} = 2^{4-3} \\cdot 5^{7-4} = 2 \\cdot 5^3$","expressionAnswer":"2*5^3"},{"label":"e","task":"$\\frac{x^4 y^2 \\cdot 2^4 \\cdot x^2}{2^2 x^3}$","solution":"$\\frac{x^4 y^2 \\cdot 2^4 \\cdot x^2}{2^2 x^3} = 2^{4-2} x^{4+2-3} y^2 = 4x^3 y^2$","expressionAnswer":"4x^3*y^2"},{"label":"f","task":"$\\frac{5^4 \\cdot 2^3 x^3}{2^2 x^2}$","solution":"$\\frac{5^4 \\cdot 2^3 x^3}{2^2 x^2} = 5^4 \\cdot 2^{3-2} \\cdot x^{3-2} = 2 \\cdot 5^4 x$","expressionAnswer":"2*5^4*x"}],"hints":["Geavat njuolggadusa $\\frac{x^a}{x^b} = x^{a-b}$"],"solution":"a) $7$, b) $a^5$, c) $a^2 b^2$, d) $2 \\cdot 5^3$, e) $4x^3 y^2$, f) $2 \\cdot 5^4 x$","solutionVideo":"eFrVTLemYTU","allowsUpload":true,"allowsCanvasDrawing":true}},{"id":"1t-1-2-def-neg","type":"definition","title":"Negatiiva eksponeanttat","content":"$$x^{-1} = \\frac{1}{x}$$\n\n$$x^{-n} = \\frac{1}{x^n}$$"},{"id":"1t-1-2-example-4","type":"example","title":"Ovdamearka 4","problem":"Čále negatiiva eksponeantta haga ja rehkenaste:\n\na) $2a^{-1}$\nb) $3^{-1}x^{-2}$\nc) $3y \\cdot 2^{-3} \\cdot x^{-3}$","solution":"**Čoavddus:**\n\na) $2a^{-1} = 2 \\cdot \\frac{1}{a} = \\color{blue}{\\frac{2}{1} \\cdot \\frac{1}{a}} = \\frac{2}{a}$\n\nb) $3^{-1}x^{-2} = \\frac{1}{3} \\cdot \\frac{1}{x^2} = \\frac{1}{3x^2}$\n\nc) $3y \\cdot 2^{-3} \\cdot x^{-3} = 3y \\cdot \\frac{1}{2^3} \\cdot \\frac{1}{x^3} = \\color{blue}{\\frac{3y}{1} \\cdot \\frac{1}{2^3 x^3}} = \\frac{3y}{8x^3}$","solutionVideo":"Xy-Hhp0_TLw"},{"id":"1t-1-2-ex-block-4","type":"exercise","exercise":{"id":"1t-1-2-ex-4","number":"4","type":"classic","difficulty":"medium","task":"Rievdat cealkaga nu ahte das ii leat šat negatiiva eksponeanta, ja rehkenaste.","subTasks":[{"label":"a","task":"$3x^{-1}$","solution":"$3x^{-1} = \\frac{3}{x}$","expressionAnswer":"3/x"},{"label":"b","task":"$4a^{-2}$","solution":"$4a^{-2} = \\frac{4}{a^2}$","expressionAnswer":"4/a^2"},{"label":"c","task":"$2^{-2} x^{-3}$","solution":"$2^{-2} x^{-3} = \\frac{1}{4x^3}$","expressionAnswer":"1/(4x^3)"},{"label":"d","task":"$a^3 a^{-5}$","solution":"$a^3 a^{-5} = a^{3-5} = a^{-2} = \\frac{1}{a^2}$","expressionAnswer":"1/a^2"},{"label":"e","task":"$8x^{-3} \\cdot 2^{-2} x^5$","solution":"$8x^{-3} \\cdot 2^{-2} x^5 = 8 \\cdot \\frac{1}{4} \\cdot x^{-3+5} = 2x^2$","expressionAnswer":"2x^2"},{"label":"f","task":"$3x^3 \\cdot x^{-5} \\cdot \\frac{2}{x^4}$","solution":"$3x^3 \\cdot x^{-5} \\cdot \\frac{2}{x^4} = \\frac{6}{x^6}$","expressionAnswer":"6/x^6"}],"hints":["$x^{-n} = \\frac{1}{x^n}$","$a^m \\cdot a^n = a^{m+n}$"],"solution":"a) $\\frac{3}{x}$, b) $\\frac{4}{a^2}$, c) $\\frac{1}{4x^3}$, d) $\\frac{1}{a^2}$, e) $2x^2$, f) $\\frac{6}{x^6}$","solutionVideo":"QM5R0dKdsLs","allowsUpload":true,"allowsCanvasDrawing":true}},{"id":"1t-1-2-text-negbrok","type":"text","content":"Go mis lea negatiiva eksponeanta cuovkkas, de fáktora mii lea loktejuvvon mášše negatiivii sáhttá sirdojuvvot cuovkkasáju vuolábeallái ja lokteduvvot dan seamma logu positiiva ovddabealmearkkain."},{"id":"1t-1-2-theorem-negbrok","type":"theorem","title":"Negatiiva eksponeanttat cuovkkain","content":"$$\\frac{a^{-n}}{b^{-m}} = \\frac{b^m}{a^n}$$"},{"id":"1t-1-2-example-5","type":"example","title":"Ovdamearka 5","problem":"Sird poteansacealkagiid nu ahte oažžut positiiva eksponeantta, ja rehkenaste:\n\na) $\\frac{2^{-5}}{3^{-2}}$\n\nb) $\\frac{2x^{-2}y^3}{x^2 y^{-1}}$","solution":"**Čoavddus:**\n\na) $\\frac{\\color{red}{2^{-5}}}{\\color{red}{3^{-2}}} = \\frac{\\color{red}{3^2}}{\\color{red}{2^5}} = \\frac{9}{32}$\n\nb) $\\frac{2\\color{red}{x^{-2}}y^3}{x^2 \\color{red}{y^{-1}}} = \\frac{2\\color{red}{y^1} \\cdot y^3}{x^2 \\cdot \\color{red}{x^2}} = \\frac{2y^4}{x^4}$","solutionVideo":"Zro8xfuqDQ4"},{"id":"1t-1-2-ex-block-5","type":"exercise","exercise":{"id":"1t-1-2-ex-5","number":"5","type":"classic","difficulty":"medium","task":"Rehkenaste ja čále bohtosa poteansan","subTasks":[{"label":"a","task":"$\\frac{2^{-2}}{3^{-1}}$","solution":"$\\frac{2^{-2}}{3^{-1}} = \\frac{3}{4}$","expressionAnswer":"3/4"},{"label":"b","task":"$\\frac{a^{-3}}{2^{-3}}$","solution":"$\\frac{a^{-3}}{2^{-3}} = \\frac{8}{a^3}$","expressionAnswer":"8/a^3"},{"label":"c","task":"$\\frac{7x^{-5}}{x^2}$","solution":"$\\frac{7x^{-5}}{x^2} = \\frac{7}{x^7}$","expressionAnswer":"7/x^7"},{"label":"d","task":"$\\frac{2x^{-1} y^2}{x^4 y^{-4}}$","solution":"$\\frac{2x^{-1} y^2}{x^4 y^{-4}} = \\frac{2y^6}{x^5}$","expressionAnswer":"2y^6/x^5"},{"label":"e","task":"$\\frac{2^{-2} y^6}{3^{-2} y^{-4}}$","solution":"$\\frac{2^{-2} y^6}{3^{-2} y^{-4}} = \\frac{9y^{10}}{4}$","expressionAnswer":"9y^10/4"},{"label":"f","task":"$\\frac{4x^{-3}}{2x^{-4}}$","solution":"$\\frac{4x^{-3}}{2x^{-4}} = 2x$","expressionAnswer":"2x"}],"hints":["$\\frac{a^{-n}}{b^{-m}} = \\frac{b^m}{a^n}$"],"solution":"a) $\\frac{3}{4}$, b) $\\frac{8}{a^3}$, c) $\\frac{7}{x^7}$, d) $\\frac{2y^6}{x^5}$, e) $\\frac{9y^{10}}{4}$, f) $2x$","solutionVideo":"uakAMiw_5zw","allowsUpload":true,"allowsCanvasDrawing":true}},{"id":"1t-1-2-theorem-produkt","type":"theorem","title":"Buktosa poteansa","content":"$$(a \\cdot b)^n = a^n \\cdot b^n$$"},{"id":"1t-1-2-example-6","type":"example","title":"Ovdamearka 6","problem":"Rehkenaste:\n\na) $(xy)^4$\nb) $(2x)^5$","solution":"**Čoavddus:**\n\na) $(xy)^4 = (x \\cdot y)^4 = x^4 \\cdot y^4 = x^4 y^4$\n\nb) $(2x)^5 = (2 \\cdot x)^5 = 2^5 \\cdot x^5 = 32 \\cdot x^5 = 32x^5$","solutionVideo":"Z3OrTkgdCR0"},{"id":"1t-1-2-ex-block-6","type":"exercise","exercise":{"id":"1t-1-2-ex-6","number":"6","type":"classic","difficulty":"lett","task":"Rehkenaste","subTasks":[{"label":"a","task":"$(3x)^2$","solution":"$(3x)^2 = 9x^2$","expressionAnswer":"9x^2"},{"label":"b","task":"$(ab)^2$","solution":"$(ab)^2 = a^2 b^2$","expressionAnswer":"a^2*b^2"},{"label":"c","task":"$3a^4 \\cdot (2a)^3$","solution":"$3a^4 \\cdot (2a)^3 = 3a^4 \\cdot 8a^3 = 24a^7$","expressionAnswer":"24a^7"}],"hints":["$(a \\cdot b)^n = a^n \\cdot b^n$"],"solution":"a) $9x^2$, b) $a^2 b^2$, c) $24a^7$","solutionVideo":"BIB5cqG2RTM","allowsUpload":true,"allowsCanvasDrawing":true}},{"id":"1t-1-2-theorem-brok","type":"theorem","title":"Cuovkka poteansa","content":"$$\\left(\\frac{a}{b}\\right)^n = \\frac{a^n}{b^n}$$"},{"id":"1t-1-2-example-7","type":"example","title":"Ovdamearka 7","problem":"Rehkenaste:\n\na) $\\left(\\frac{x}{y}\\right)^4$\n\nb) $\\left(\\frac{2}{3x}\\right)^2$","solution":"**Čoavddus:**\n\na) $\\left(\\frac{x}{y}\\right)^4 = \\frac{x^4}{y^4}$\n\nb) $\\left(\\frac{2}{3x}\\right)^2 = \\frac{2^2}{(3x)^2} = \\frac{4}{3^2 x^2} = \\frac{4}{9x^2}$","solutionVideo":"Kc1oGcdzt98"},{"id":"1t-1-2-ex-block-7","type":"exercise","exercise":{"id":"1t-1-2-ex-7","number":"7","type":"classic","difficulty":"medium","task":"Rehkenaste ja čále bohtosa poteansan","subTasks":[{"label":"a","task":"$\\left(\\frac{a}{b}\\right)^8$","solution":"$\\left(\\frac{a}{b}\\right)^8 = \\frac{a^8}{b^8}$","expressionAnswer":"a^8/b^8"},{"label":"b","task":"$\\left(\\frac{2a}{3}\\right)^2$","solution":"$\\left(\\frac{2a}{3}\\right)^2 = \\frac{4a^2}{9}$","expressionAnswer":"4a^2/9"},{"label":"c","task":"$\\left(\\frac{x}{5y}\\right)^2$","solution":"$\\left(\\frac{x}{5y}\\right)^2 = \\frac{x^2}{25y^2}$","expressionAnswer":"x^2/(25y^2)"},{"label":"d","task":"$\\left(\\frac{x}{y}\\right)^4 \\cdot \\left(\\frac{2x}{y^2}\\right)$","solution":"$\\left(\\frac{x}{y}\\right)^4 \\cdot \\left(\\frac{2x}{y^2}\\right) = \\frac{2x^5}{y^6}$","expressionAnswer":"2x^5/y^6"},{"label":"e","task":"$\\left(\\frac{a}{3}\\right)^4 \\cdot 3^3 a$","solution":"$\\left(\\frac{a}{3}\\right)^4 \\cdot 3^3 a = \\frac{a^5}{3}$","expressionAnswer":"a^5/3"},{"label":"f","task":"$\\left(\\frac{a}{2b}\\right)^2 \\cdot 3a^{-2} b^{-2}$","solution":"$\\left(\\frac{a}{2b}\\right)^2 \\cdot 3a^{-2} b^{-2} = \\frac{3}{4b^4}$","expressionAnswer":"3/(4b^4)"}],"hints":["$\\left(\\frac{a}{b}\\right)^n = \\frac{a^n}{b^n}$"],"solution":"a) $\\frac{a^8}{b^8}$, b) $\\frac{4a^2}{9}$, c) $\\frac{x^2}{25y^2}$, d) $\\frac{2x^5}{y^6}$, e) $\\frac{a^5}{3}$, f) $\\frac{3}{4b^4}$","solutionVideo":"WlybJzdW09s","allowsUpload":true,"allowsCanvasDrawing":true}},{"id":"1t-1-2-theorem-potenspotens","type":"theorem","title":"Poteansa poteansa","content":"$$(x^a)^b = x^{a \\cdot b}$$"},{"id":"1t-1-2-example-8","type":"example","title":"Ovdamearka 8","problem":"Rehkenaste:\n\na) $(x^4)^3$\nb) $(2a^3)^4$\nc) $\\left(\\frac{y^2}{x}\\right)^3$","solution":"**Čoavddus:**\n\na) $(x^4)^3 = x^{4 \\cdot 3} = x^{12}$\n\nb) $(2a^3)^4 = 2^4 \\cdot (a^3)^4 = 16a^{3 \\cdot 4} = 16a^{12}$\n\nc) $\\left(\\frac{y^2}{x}\\right)^3 = \\frac{(y^2)^3}{x^3} = \\frac{y^{2 \\cdot 3}}{x^3} = \\frac{y^6}{x^3}$","solutionVideo":"sYylholvW14"},{"id":"1t-1-2-ex-block-8","type":"exercise","exercise":{"id":"1t-1-2-ex-8","number":"8","type":"classic","difficulty":"vanskelig","task":"Rehkenaste","subTasks":[{"label":"a","task":"$(x^2)^3$","solution":"$(x^2)^3 = x^6$","expressionAnswer":"x^6"},{"label":"b","task":"$(5a^2)^2$","solution":"$(5a^2)^2 = 25a^4$","expressionAnswer":"25a^4"},{"label":"c","task":"$\\left(\\frac{a^4}{3}\\right)^3$","solution":"$\\left(\\frac{a^4}{3}\\right)^3 = \\frac{a^{12}}{27}$","expressionAnswer":"a^12/27"},{"label":"d","task":"$(ab^2)^3$","solution":"$(ab^2)^3 = a^3 b^6$","expressionAnswer":"a^3*b^6"},{"label":"e","task":"$\\left(\\frac{2x^3}{y^2}\\right)^3$","solution":"$\\left(\\frac{2x^3}{y^2}\\right)^3 = \\frac{8x^9}{y^6}$","expressionAnswer":"8x^9/y^6"},{"label":"f","task":"$x^3 \\cdot \\left(\\frac{x^2}{y^2}\\right)^3$","solution":"$x^3 \\cdot \\left(\\frac{x^2}{y^2}\\right)^3 = \\frac{x^9}{y^6}$","expressionAnswer":"x^9/y^6"},{"label":"g","task":"$\\left(\\frac{a^{-3}}{b^{-2}}\\right)^4$","solution":"$\\left(\\frac{a^{-3}}{b^{-2}}\\right)^4 = \\frac{b^8}{a^{12}}$","expressionAnswer":"b^8/a^12"},{"label":"h","task":"$\\left(\\frac{2^{-1}a}{a^{-2}b^2}\\right)^2 \\cdot (a^2)^{-3}$","solution":"$\\left(\\frac{2^{-1}a}{a^{-2}b^2}\\right)^2 \\cdot (a^2)^{-3} = \\frac{1}{4b^4}$","expressionAnswer":"1/(4b^4)"},{"label":"i","task":"$y^3 \\left(\\frac{4^{-2}x}{x^{-2}y^2 \\cdot 2^{-3}}\\right)^3$","solution":"$y^3 \\left(\\frac{4^{-2}x}{x^{-2}y^2 \\cdot 2^{-3}}\\right)^3 = \\frac{x^9}{8y^3}$","expressionAnswer":"x^9/(8y^3)"}],"hints":["$(x^a)^b = x^{a \\cdot b}$","Ovttastahte máŋga njuolggadusa"],"solution":"a) $x^6$, b) $25a^4$, c) $\\frac{a^{12}}{27}$, d) $a^3 b^6$, e) $\\frac{8x^9}{y^6}$, f) $\\frac{x^9}{y^6}$, g) $\\frac{b^8}{a^{12}}$, h) $\\frac{1}{4b^4}$, i) $\\frac{x^9}{8y^3}$","solutionVideo":"tFwhmNDq3sw","allowsUpload":true,"allowsCanvasDrawing":true,"aiGradingEnabled":true}},{"id":"1t-1-2-def-null","type":"definition","title":"Go mis lea 0 eksponeantan","content":"$$a^0 = 1, \\text{ go } a \\neq 0$$\n\ndat mearkkaša ahte buot logut (earret 0) loktejuvvon mášše 0:i šaddet 1."},{"id":"1t-1-2-warning-0-0","type":"warning","title":"Ja $0^0$?","content":"Cealkka $0^0$ lea **meroštkeahtes** matematihkas. Dat boahtá das go mii oažžut vuostálaga bohtosiid das movt mii lahkonit cealkaga. Danin lea dehálaš muitit ahte njuolggadus $a^0 = 1$ gusto dušše go $a \\neq 0$."},{"id":"1t-1-2-example-9","type":"example","title":"Ovdamearka 9","problem":"Rehkenaste:\n\na) $3^0$\nb) $(-9000)^0$\nc) $2x^0$ gos $x \\neq 0$","solution":"**Čoavddus:**\n\na) $3^0 = 1$\n\nb) $(-9000)^0 = 1$\n\nc) $2x^0 = 2 \\cdot x^0 = 2 \\cdot 1 = 2$","solutionVideo":"ISv5BsDdmm8"},{"id":"1t-1-2-ex-block-9","type":"exercise","exercise":{"id":"